This directory is a modified copy of the taffy 0.15.0 crate
(https://github.com/DioxusLabs/taffy), licensed under the MIT License in
LICENSE.md. zyuapp changed it in 2026: a `flex: none` item with a negative
margin keeps its size in intrinsic sizing even when its inner flex basis is 0;
centred flex offsets truncate to a set layout unit; nodes with `snap_origin`
sit on whole pixels, and a root's layout can be rounded again from where it is
placed. The examples, dev-dependencies and their manifest entries were removed.
